Scope of this repository
------------------------

* patches/0001-...patch is a git-format-patch mbox against magpie's
  internal/gateway package. It modifies two lines of magpie's own
  internal/gateway/codeassist.go and adds one new test file. The modified
  lines remain magpie's code, governed by magpie's MIT license. This
  repository is NOT a fork of magpie and does not redistribute magpie's
  source tree; only the unified diff is included.

* tests/plain_schema_empty_enum_test.go is a copy of the new test file
  included in the patch. It is offered under the MIT License in LICENSE.
  It is written against magpie's internal/gateway package and is only
  buildable inside a magpie checkout.

* selfcheck/ is an original, dependency-free Go module that models the
  relevant enum/const handling in isolation. It contains no magpie source
  code. It is offered under the MIT License in LICENSE.

* docs/ and README files are original text offered under the MIT License
  in LICENSE.

magpie's README.md states: "This repository doesn't take pull requests.
Only maintainers can open them. If you'd like a fix or a feature, describe
it on Discord and we'll build it." This repository is a description plus a
